/-- **Proposition 4.5, completeness, for all 191 classes.** For the representative of a class, every pair of
complete trees with heights satisfying the conditions of Lemma 4.3 and `ℓ(x) ≤ 0` (`Cond`) has the key of a stored
line of the class: the same trees (as node sets, with the body on the leaf of `O`) and the same argmin sets. -/
theorem f2s_cells_sound : ∀ k < 191, ∀ Xz Xw : ExpTree, Cond (L6.F2.diagOf k) Xz Xw →
    ∃ line ∈ ((L6.F2.Checks.cellsOf k).splitOn "\n").filter (· != ""),
      keyOfLine line = some (Xz.T.key, Xw.T.key, argminString (L6.F2.diagOf k) Xz Xw) :=
  fun k hk _ _ hX => cell_stored (keys_all k hk) (f2s_order k hk) hX

end L6.F2S.Checks
